            "description_html": "<b>Pemko 271 Saddle Threshold</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pemko Door Saddle Threshold is made from non rusting extruded aluminum. It meets ADA Barrier Free Requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko Door Threshold:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Dark Bronze Anodized</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMeets <b>ADA Barrier Free Requirements</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall height is no greater than 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>A vertical rise no more than 1/4\" and/or change in elevation being beveled with a slope of 1:2</li>\r\n<li>Non-Skid/Pemkote – Meets the requirements of ASTM D 2047, UL 410, and Federal Specifications P-F-</li>\r\n<li>430C for high static coefficient of friction resulting in a slip resistance surface</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial Ordered Item. <b>No Returns</b>\r\n</p>",
